  "description": "AI agent framework for natural-language querying of systems biology models from the BioModels database (EMBL-EBI). Enables researchers to interrogate quantitative pharmacology (QSP) and systems pharmacology models via chat without writing simulation code. Integrates LangChain/LangGraph, Semantic Scholar, and Streamlit. Part of the AIAgents4Pharma suite. Published in BMC Bioinformatics 2025.",
